#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-adapters.rst:5
#: 0f496fcc707748ee87b40466a1fd4945
msgid "Ethernet Adapters and Switches"
msgstr "以太网适配器和交换机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-adapters.rst:7
#: 45aee5ae7dbf4ee09910adcac8b5e716
msgid ""
"Ardupilot has the ability to use Ethernet peripherals and networking (see "
":ref:`common-network`).  This page includes various switches and adapters "
"known to work"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 具备使用以太网外设和网络的能力（参见 :ref:`common-network`）。本页收录了已知可兼容的各类交换机和适配器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-adapters.rst:12
#: ef0d5321faba45caaa9e1612eff9c928
msgid ""
"Most H7 based autopilots do not include native ethernet support but ethernet"
" networking capability can be added using an Ethernet Adapter (see "
":ref:`BotBlox DroneNet <common-botblox-dronenet>` and :ref:`CubePilot "
"CubeNode ETH <common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth>` below) which provide "
"connectivity using :ref:`PPP protocol <ppp-config>` over the autopilot's "
"serial port."
msgstr ""
"大多数基于 H7 的飞控不具备原生以太网支持，但可通过以太网适配器（参见下方 :ref:`BotBlox DroneNet <common-"
"botblox-dronenet>` 和 :ref:`CubePilot CubeNode ETH <common-cubepilot-"
"cubenodeeth>`）添加以太网网络功能，这些适配器通过飞控串口使用 :ref:`PPP 协议 <ppp-config>` 提供连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-adapters.rst:15
#: a333a85a26eb4c14b34544934eb1b1cb
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-adapters.rst:17
#: a91a40b3f4ff426e9692b29a4e2a8ce9
msgid ""
"`BlueRobotics Ethernet Switch <https://bluerobotics.com/store/comm-control-"
"power/tether-interface/ethswitch/>`__ : 5-port ethernet switch designed in "
"collaboration with BotBlox"
msgstr ""
"`BlueRobotics 以太网交换机 <https://bluerobotics.com/store/comm-control-"
"power/tether-interface/ethswitch/>`__：与 BotBlox 合作设计的 5 口以太网交换机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-adapters.rst:18
#: 7b7dec37c8e64bcba02ce7e4eb84d458
msgid ""
"`BotBlox SwitchBlox for Ardupilot <https://botblox.io/switchblox-for-"
"ardupilot/>`__ : ethernet switch to allow connecting multiple devices "
"together"
msgstr ""
"`BotBlox SwitchBlox for ArduPilot <https://botblox.io/switchblox-for-"
"ardupilot/>`__：以太网交换机，可将多个设备连接在一起"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-adapters.rst:19
#: 77e042cdb745471eb374d159b324d8c5
msgid ""
":ref:`BotBlox DroneNet for Ardupilot <common-botblox-dronenet>`: ethernet "
"switch with CAN, USART, RS485, and GPIO/PWM adapters allowing non-ethernet "
"devices including autopilots to work over ethernet"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BotBlox DroneNet for ArduPilot <common-botblox-dronenet>`：配备 "
"CAN、USART、RS485 和 GPIO/PWM 适配器的以太网交换机，允许包括飞控在内的非以太网设备通过以太网工作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-adapters.rst:20
#: 41e42b0f879e4838ab63915dee120fc4
msgid ""
"`BotBlox SwitchBlox Cable Adapter for Ardupilot "
"<https://botblox.io/switchblox-cable-adapter-for-ardupilot/>`__ : adapter to"
" ease the ethernet port differences across different device manufacturers"
msgstr ""
"`BotBlox SwitchBlox 线缆适配器 for ArduPilot <https://botblox.io/switchblox-"
"cable-adapter-for-ardupilot/>`__：用于统一不同设备制造商之间以太网接口差异的适配器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-adapters.rst:21
#: bb595c58da2d41008627d3e2a7ec422a
msgid ""
":ref:`CubePilot CubeNode ETH <common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth>`: serial to "
"ethernet adapter to allow non-ethernet autopilots to work over ethernet "
"using PPP"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CubePilot CubeNode ETH <common-cubepilot-"
"cubenodeeth>`：串口转以太网适配器，允许非以太网飞控通过以太网使用 PPP 协议工作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-adapters.rst:22
#: 7264c7377a7f4b0e8d5f051e6cf0ed2f
msgid ""
"`CubePilot CubeLAN 8-Port Switch <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/switch/cubelan-8-port-switch>`__ : ethernet switch using the "
"CubePilot preferred 5-pin connector"
msgstr ""
"`CubePilot CubeLAN 8 口交换机 <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/switch/cubelan-8-port-switch>`__：使用 CubePilot 首选 5 针连接器的以太网交换机"
